# SharePoint adapter: reading and writing SharePoint files
error-sp-action-key-used = That change has already been sent to SharePoint. Nothing more to do.
error-sp-datastore-unavailable = ordin can't reach its saved work just now. Try again in a moment.
error-sp-location-invalid = The saved SharePoint location or the file name isn't valid. Link it again or choose another name.
error-sp-name-exists = A file with that name already exists. Choose another name.
error-sp-not-tracked = ordin isn't tracking changes for that link yet. Sync it first.
error-sp-origin-changed = The file changed in SharePoint after you read it. Bring in the latest version and try again.
error-sp-outcome-unknown = The SharePoint upload took too long and may have gone through. Check SharePoint before trying again.
error-sp-response-invalid = SharePoint sent back something ordin couldn't read. Try again in a moment.
error-sp-too-large = That file is too big for SharePoint. The limit is 250 MB.
